  <VaultAllowWithdraw>Allow withdrawing</VaultAllowWithdraw>
  <VaultAllowWithdrawDesc>When enabled, haulers may automatically take items, and workbench ingredients and eating/treatment search see this building's contents (enabled by default).</VaultAllowWithdrawDesc>
  <VaultAllowTakeForUse>Allow taking for use while withdrawing is disallowed</VaultAllowTakeForUse>
