  <!-- Freeze toggle -->
  <VaultFrozen>Frozen</VaultFrozen>
  <VaultFrozenDesc>When enabled, hides all items in this building and pauses its work (the storage filter is left unchanged, and items remain in the outerrealm storage). Disable to show them again.</VaultFrozenDesc>

